{"versions":[{"path":"versions/9cd6abdd-30ec-4e5b-8953-cb3be0820ff9/62220f5da0329ca33377d9ffa8656a4a2ff171a73c0c86cadb2dce92ef6c5f36.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"9cd6abdd-30ec-4e5b-8953-cb3be0820ff9","revision":"sha256:62220f5da0329ca33377d9ffa8656a4a2ff171a73c0c86cadb2dce92ef6c5f36","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"第一、第三四分位数之间的区间叫什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"[Q1,Q3] 是中间50%数据所在的区间; 其宽度 Q3-Q1 称为四分位距 / interquartile range (IQR)\n若原题把区间简称为IQR, 应注意IQR严格指两四分位数之差"}]}}},{"path":"versions/990a7904-efd9-4142-8ed9-4c36e6eec61c/b73fbd17d4a29dca23e10af7d4c6aa4945ca56d6010696a2bb9b0604085dff02.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"990a7904-efd9-4142-8ed9-4c36e6eec61c","revision":"sha256:b73fbd17d4a29dca23e10af7d4c6aa4945ca56d6010696a2bb9b0604085dff02","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"衣服颜色、地区等数据属于什么数据？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"名义分类数据 / nominal categorical data, 类别本身没有大小次序"}]}}},{"path":"versions/17413508-488b-45b2-b9d3-477828202726/408a82c1879e17dbb4fa27471e214014fce0b854ecc15b229ef50103e8708d0e.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"17413508-488b-45b2-b9d3-477828202726","revision":"sha256:408a82c1879e17dbb4fa27471e214014fce0b854ecc15b229ef50103e8708d0e","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"-1, 1, 2, 3, 100 这一组数据属于左偏还是右偏分布等。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"右偏 / positively skewed. 100使右侧尾部很长, 均值=105/5=21, 中位数=2, 均值明显大于中位数"}]}}},{"path":"versions/bd2fcb14-92f0-4df2-9a64-4b6832ecfb12/d056a1381fc53d7e8a9f802e669852343f2c169c45658df8cc1c4dc89ce74fbe.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"bd2fcb14-92f0-4df2-9a64-4b6832ecfb12","revision":"sha256:d056a1381fc53d7e8a9f802e669852343f2c169c45658df8cc1c4dc89ce74fbe","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"描述数据集中趋势的指标中，哪一个受极值和偏移影响较大？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"算术均值对极端值较敏感, 因为每个观测值直接进入总和. 中位数通常对少数极端值更稳健\n若“偏移”指全体数据统一加常数, 均值和中位数都会等量平移, 不能将平移敏感性与极端值敏感性混同"}]}}},{"path":"versions/b13c84a9-8803-4c8b-a115-6805d3e451e7/8b46046c0c05be03d7a477b0b29b6dd82ba9756ee3cdeb2672a95a45e3f7e88d.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"b13c84a9-8803-4c8b-a115-6805d3e451e7","revision":"sha256:8b46046c0c05be03d7a477b0b29b6dd82ba9756ee3cdeb2672a95a45e3f7e88d","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"PDB 对什么物质的三维结构进行建模？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"主要是蛋白质, 也包括DNA/RNA等核酸及其复合物的三维结构. PDB是结构档案库, 不是仅凭序列自动预测结构的单一算法\n核验来源: [PDB档案说明论文](https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky949)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/a29a3a91-d7dd-480a-81ae-87ab69d2f328/0fa8c764b0d813e6c6ad663c9f62abcb725f2f6e6184239ace60023aff2bd974.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"a29a3a91-d7dd-480a-81ae-87ab69d2f328","revision":"sha256:0fa8c764b0d813e6c6ad663c9f62abcb725f2f6e6184239ace60023aff2bd974","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"第一类错误指什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"第一类错误 / Type I error: H0事实上为真却拒绝H0. 在检验模型成立时, 其发生概率由显著性水平α控制"}]}}},{"path":"versions/f312994d-dc75-4a7d-96b5-7696d04d7afd/e949b1bb13bc67e6035512b5bc3803e7010f6e82f79f8be5dbc1e7d90d2eb545.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"f312994d-dc75-4a7d-96b5-7696d04d7afd","revision":"sha256:e949b1bb13bc67e6035512b5bc3803e7010f6e82f79f8be5dbc1e7d90d2eb545","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"样本均值的 95% 置信区间表示什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"通常是用样本均值构造总体均值μ的95%置信区间. 若反复按相同方案抽样并构造区间, 长期约95%的区间覆盖固定的μ\n它不是95%的个体落入该区间, 也不是频率学解释下该次固定区间内μ有95%的概率"}]}}},{"path":"versions/9fc662cf-5366-4e1c-a54c-efcb9500aeb9/7b59fdad5a6c0e8a49eb7e92fe25e6450a08947353006b4d89e020e9f45cb0be.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"9fc662cf-5366-4e1c-a54c-efcb9500aeb9","revision":"sha256:7b59fdad5a6c0e8a49eb7e92fe25e6450a08947353006b4d89e020e9f45cb0be","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"哪些因素决定置信限（limit of confidence）？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"以总体均值区间为例, 上下限=x̄±临界值×SE. 因此由样本均值, 置信水平, 数据变异程度, 样本量以及采用的分布/模型决定\nσ已知时SE=σ/√n并用z临界值; σ未知且采用t区间时SE=s/√n并用t临界值, df=n-1"}]}}},{"path":"versions/977e9759-5ce6-4ec4-ae52-aed18591f869/c09ee3cf78ccf1c1fd309987601edd92ed058243149bc223fdcb91d67d6f588a.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"977e9759-5ce6-4ec4-ae52-aed18591f869","revision":"sha256:c09ee3cf78ccf1c1fd309987601edd92ed058243149bc223fdcb91d67d6f588a","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"根据一份 R 语言检验输出，判断使用的是配对或独立样本 t 检验、单尾或双尾检验。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"待确认: R输出未记录\n标题为 Paired t-test 表示配对; Two Sample t-test 通常为等方差独立双样本; Welch Two Sample t-test 为Welch独立双样本\nalternative hypothesis 中 not equal to 表示双侧, greater than 表示右侧, less than 表示左侧; 不能只用t的正负判断单双侧"}]}}},{"path":"versions/cb7979e0-f847-45d8-92ae-e248fd2c9c32/5308dfed8a5feae6663cc85fe1a0fe0601c42073e30b9bdd40739955472c7d62.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"cb7979e0-f847-45d8-92ae-e248fd2c9c32","revision":"sha256:5308dfed8a5feae6663cc85fe1a0fe0601c42073e30b9bdd40739955472c7d62","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"已知一个样本的均值和方差，求包含总体中 95% 个体的区间；原回忆特别提示这与置信区间不同。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"待确认: 样本均值, 方差及分布条件未记录\n若总体近似正态, 描述总体中间95%个体的常用估计区间为 x̄±1.96s, 其中s为样本标准差. 这不是均值的95%置信区间 x̄±t×s/√n\n若要求以指定置信度保证覆盖总体95%个体, 应计算统计容忍区间 x̄±ks; k还依赖样本量与置信度, 不能直接用1.96"}]}}},{"path":"versions/95dac6d0-a7f8-44d0-b121-7222475bf807/9bdb490e8f9b7e95ef450d3969b73aa6283aaf604aa7c3ee0d87b0a0af90adf0.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"95dac6d0-a7f8-44d0-b121-7222475bf807","revision":"sha256:9bdb490e8f9b7e95ef450d3969b73aa6283aaf604aa7c3ee0d87b0a0af90adf0","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"辨析 dnorm、pnorm 等 R 函数的输出。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"dnorm(x,mean,sd) 返回正态概率密度, 不等于连续变量取恰好x的概率; pnorm(q,mean,sd) 默认返回P(X≤q); lower.tail=FALSE 返回P(X>q)\nqnorm(p,mean,sd) 返回累积概率为p的分位数; rnorm(n,mean,sd) 生成n个正态随机数\n原题具体参数和选项缺失, 无法给具体输出"}]}}},{"path":"versions/34818f9a-a721-491d-8868-4c9b4a66ed82/88e73b92847abcb97424485e51c290577e9540df01adbbb81616c3913ff9fb9f.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"34818f9a-a721-491d-8868-4c9b4a66ed82","revision":"sha256:88e73b92847abcb97424485e51c290577e9540df01adbbb81616c3913ff9fb9f","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"暴露组与非暴露组发病比例之比叫什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"相对危险度 / relative risk (risk ratio), RR=P(发病|暴露)/P(发病|未暴露). 需两个比例使用相容的观察时段与风险人群定义"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7abb0e28-7fa5-4c63-9300-f0734e9ce960/de26c346d18a77fd2e9bd52163bd8491b2341b7086f7449d1b44734b50ea4705.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"7abb0e28-7fa5-4c63-9300-f0734e9ce960","revision":"sha256:de26c346d18a77fd2e9bd52163bd8491b2341b7086f7449d1b44734b50ea4705","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"根据男女两组体重数据判断应使用哪一种检验。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"若男女是两组互不相关的人且比较总体平均体重, 用独立双样本t检验. 不预设方差齐性时可用Welch; 若方差齐性合理可用合并方差t检验\n数据, 分布和设计细节缺失, 无法确定原题唯一检验或计算结果"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d5929288-3b78-4534-920e-76540ed617d3/812935a0c9529d0a90785bcdbe8532fdea7a2d36e1239bfb1b4c7fd7af1be87f.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"d5929288-3b78-4534-920e-76540ed617d3","revision":"sha256:812935a0c9529d0a90785bcdbe8532fdea7a2d36e1239bfb1b4c7fd7af1be87f","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"承上题，计算或判断自由度。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"等方差独立双样本t检验 df=n1+n2-2\nWelch检验 df=(s1²/n1+s2²/n2)² / [(s1²/n1)²/(n1-1)+(s2²/n2)²/(n2-1)]\n承上题的样本量和方差未记录, 数值待确认"}]}}},{"path":"versions/26b94276-a630-46ad-a155-8bf8f898b13f/9ef7e9694433f537a84c2870842512a2e1654164a743eef569a5c3bb957340fb.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"26b94276-a630-46ad-a155-8bf8f898b13f","revision":"sha256:9ef7e9694433f537a84c2870842512a2e1654164a743eef569a5c3bb957340fb","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"承上题，根据结果判断是否接受假设。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"若p<预先设定的α, 拒绝H0; 若p≥α, 不拒绝H0, 不能据此证明H0成立或两总体完全相同\n原题检验输出和α未记录, 结论待确认"}]}}},{"path":"versions/9effba1b-12a2-4e86-ab47-776cdaf9d3fd/85fcad71f0e5c07119095be5bc31198b87384225211b74eb2927e4aa3f15ae7d.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"9effba1b-12a2-4e86-ab47-776cdaf9d3fd","revision":"sha256:85fcad71f0e5c07119095be5bc31198b87384225211b74eb2927e4aa3f15ae7d","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"关于 PubMed 的叙述，选择正确的一项。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"可确认的知识点: PubMed提供生物医学文献的题录与摘要检索, 包含MEDLINE等来源, 部分记录链接到PMC或出版社全文; PubMed本身并不保证每条记录都有免费全文\n原题选项缺失, 无法选择唯一项\n核验来源: [PubMed Help](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/help/)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/e1367c42-3d21-42dc-bfe6-2e8f1e7f05d1/f134a0ce0ff62f505b089b6402de016ca44db9cbbdb65b0263e81932dfce7482.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"e1367c42-3d21-42dc-bfe6-2e8f1e7f05d1","revision":"sha256:f134a0ce0ff62f505b089b6402de016ca44db9cbbdb65b0263e81932dfce7482","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"（5 分）给出核电站周围唐氏综合征病例数和某州出生缺陷中唐氏综合征病例数，判断核电站是否对周围有影响。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"若给出观察病例数k与依据参照患病率得到的期望病例数λ, 可在H0下设X~Poisson(λ), 对“是否增加”用单侧p=P(X≥k); α水平下p<α才提示超额病例\n如果给的是两个样本的病例数及各自总人数, 应比较两个比例, 如2×2列联表检验. 不能仅凭两地区病例总数直接比较风险\n本回忆缺具体数值与分母, 检验结果待确认"}]}}},{"path":"versions/4dc1339f-c5c9-4346-95c5-d19fe2121178/1824762268c6a2e7be72bf03ff7c9a2a142e265eaa143121a8b71f18a0c7303e.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"4dc1339f-c5c9-4346-95c5-d19fe2121178","revision":"sha256:1824762268c6a2e7be72bf03ff7c9a2a142e265eaa143121a8b71f18a0c7303e","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"（5 分）给出总体方差、样本均值和样本方差，判断样本均值是否显著高于期望值。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"总体方差σ²已知时用右侧单样本z检验: H0: μ=μ0, H1: μ>μ0, z=(x̄-μ0)/(σ/√n), p=1-Φ(z)\n比较z与z1-α; α=0.05时临界值约1.645. 已知总体方差时不必用样本方差替代\n缺σ²,n,x̄,μ0与原题α, 数值结论待确认"}]}}},{"path":"versions/1b9b0f56-33a4-42a4-a553-2143aa1c01ab/4d6e297f0ab3a4c2047b86a5847b1cf965e97069ce557909601c584b11a339d9.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"1b9b0f56-33a4-42a4-a553-2143aa1c01ab","revision":"sha256:4d6e297f0ab3a4c2047b86a5847b1cf965e97069ce557909601c584b11a339d9","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"（15 分）对一个 2 × 2 表进行卡方检验：求自由度与各格期望频数，计算卡方值并作出结论。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"2×2 Pearson卡方独立性检验的df=(2-1)(2-1)=1. 各格期望频数 Eij=第i行合计×第j列合计/N, χ²=Σ(Oij-Eij)²/Eij\n在α=0.05时临界值为3.8415, χ²大于此值则拒绝独立性H0. 若期望频数过小, 应考虑Fisher精确检验\n原观察频数缺失, 不能填数值期望表或给实际结论"}]}}},{"path":"versions/e5f29ff0-ae1e-49f7-9d4b-3b424b043c44/2f7298781bc2aafaf4f803f14a7e065524fc7199ebf2023c0e40306ec7c3d60e.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"e5f29ff0-ae1e-49f7-9d4b-3b424b043c44","revision":"sha256:2f7298781bc2aafaf4f803f14a7e065524fc7199ebf2023c0e40306ec7c3d60e","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"（10 分）根据线性拟合的 R summary() 输出写出拟合方程；由决定系数（coefficient of determination）计算相关系数（correlation coefficient）。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"拟合方程 ŷ=Intercept的Estimate + x系数的Estimate×x\n只有在含截距的简单线性回归中, Pearson r=sign(斜率)√R²; 不能遗漏斜率的正负号\nR输出未记录, 无法给具体方程和相关系数"}]}}},{"path":"versions/253b3c66-3303-4230-b804-67f29fc3dda2/95e9369191426ee9c0abb75298003ab0d6bf36d6f19590bc3a473fb8b266e6e3.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"253b3c66-3303-4230-b804-67f29fc3dda2","revision":"sha256:95e9369191426ee9c0abb75298003ab0d6bf36d6f19590bc3a473fb8b266e6e3","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"（15 分）根据独立双样本 t 检验数据表选择检验方式、确定自由度、计算 t 值并作出结论。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"两组独立且方差齐性合理: sp²=[(n1-1)s1²+(n2-1)s2²]/(n1+n2-2), t=(x̄1-x̄2-Δ0)/[sp√(1/n1+1/n2)], df=n1+n2-2\n若不假设方差相等, 用Welch t=(x̄1-x̄2-Δ0)/√(s1²/n1+s2²/n2), df使用Welch-Satterthwaite公式\n比较均值“是否不同”为双侧; “是否更高/更低”在事先指定时为单侧. 以p和α作拒绝/不拒绝H0判断\n原数据表及具体假设缺失, 数值答案待确认"}]}}}]}